 "notes": "UNVERIFIED AGAINST OFFICIAL SOURCES. All *.ju.edu.jo pages (registration, faculties, PDFs) returned a WAF 'Request Rejected' page to the fetcher, and admhec.gov.jo and the MoHE 2026-2027 academic-track majors PDF are blocked by robots.txt, so nothing here was read from an official page. Major names (Arabic) are copied verbatim from two third-party sites (ween.ps, jam3ah.ai) that reproduce Unified Admission (admhec) lists; they agree on almost all names. Assignment of majors to colleges, college Arabic names and ALL English names are from general knowledge of JU's structure, not verified. Conflicts/uncertain: ween.ps lists 'تنسيق المواقع وإنتاج الأزهار', jam3ah.ai lists 'تصميم وتنسيق المواقع' (same programme, name unclear). Nursing appears as gendered admission tracks ('التمريض / ذكور وإناث', 'التمريض / إناث', 'التمريض / ذكور') - merged into one major. 'الإحصاء وعلم البيانات', 'إدارة الضيافة', 'إدارة الفعاليات', 'الذكاء الاصطناعي' appear only in jam3ah.ai; their college placement is a guess. 'التسويق الرقمي' appears on jam3ah.ai with unclear campus - omitted. School of Arts and Design (كلية الفنون والتصميم) and Aviation Engineering admit via direct admission outside the unified list (per husna.fm); their majors could not be verified and are omitted. JU reportedly has 26 schools and 106 undergraduate programmes (AARU ranking page), so this list (19 colleges) is incomplete - e.g. Graduate School and Aqaba-branch schools are not listed. Email: ju.edu.jo is the university's domain; whether students use ju.edu.jo or a subdomain for Microsoft 365 could not be verified (a JU medicine-student guide says students get the address from the registration system but does not show the format). Center coordinates are from Wikipedia (32°0'50\"N 35°52'22\"E), not OpenStreetMap. Brand colour: Wikipedia says 'royal yellow and green' but no hex from the official visual identity, so null. e-learning/portal URLs not verified, so omitted. Aqaba branch (aqaba.ju.edu.jo, est. 2009) - not included as colleges. Third-party lists show Aqaba majors such as: أنظمة المعلومات الحاسوبية، تكنولوجيا معلومات الأعمال، التمريض، العلوم الحياتية، المحاسبة، التمويل، إدارة الأعمال، اللغة العربية وآدابها، اللغة الانجليزية وآدابها، اللغة الفرنسية / الانجليزية، اللغة الإنجليزية التطبيقية، الادارة السياحية، إدارة الفنادق، الحقوق، إدارة الجودة والعمليات، الامن السيبراني والشبكات الذكية (unverified). UPDATE Nov 2026: School of Arts and Design now has 5 bachelor majors. Their Arabic names come from the titles of the school's official study-plan files on artsdesign.ju.edu.jo (seen in search results; the files themselves returned JU's WAF 'Request Rejected' page, so the content was not read). The music plan is dated 24-9-2024. These programmes admit by direct admission with an aptitude test, not via the unified list. English names are translations. A second check of ween.ps (91 rows incl. Aqaba duplicates) matched the existing 81-major list; no majors were removed. dirasaabroad.com lists departments, not programmes, so it was used only to confirm the Arts and Design departments (Visual Arts, Music, Theatre Arts). Aqaba branch (third-party, unverified) faculties: كلية الأعمال، كلية السياحة والفندقة، كلية العلوم الأساسية والبحرية (البيئة الساحلية، الأحياء البحرية)، كلية اللغات، كلية نظم وتكنولوجيا المعلومات، التمريض; Aqaba majors are in the earlier note and are kept out of the colleges list on purpose. Aviation/aerospace engineering at JU was mentioned by husna.fm, but no programme page or study plan was found, so it is not listed. ju.edu.jo, its subdomains and the MoHE/admhec lists were still blocked. BUILDINGS: empty list on purpose. OpenStreetMap could not be queried from this session (Nov 2026): overpass-api.de, overpass.kumi.systems, nominatim.openstreetmap.org and the OSM API were all refused by the fetch allowlist/egress proxy, and OSM element pages found via search show no coordinates for ways. No building coordinates were guessed. Campus center was NOT re-checked against OSM for the same reason (kept from the draft source named above).",
